### SCENARIO: Batch sync from HCM — new balances and conflict detection

### Step 1: Seed and create a pending request to set up a conflict
POST http://localhost:3000/balances/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-10",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "available": 15,
  "used": 3
}

### Step 2: Create a pending request for 8 days
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-10",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-06-01",
  "endDate": "2026-06-12",
  "days": 8,
  "idempotencyKey": "sync-conflict-001"
}

### Step 3: Batch sync reduces emp-10 balance — conflict detected
# HCM says only 5 available now, but emp-10 has 8 days pending
# Expected: applied=1, conflicts=1 (balance updated, conflict logged)
POST http://localhost:3000/sync/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "workday",
  "timestamp": "2026-04-10T00:00:00Z",
  "balances": [
    { "employeeId": "emp-10", "locationId": "loc-nyc", "policyType": "VACATION", "available": 5, "used": 3 }
  ]
}

### Step 4: Check balance — available updated to 5, pending still 8, effectiveAvailable negative
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-10/loc-nyc

###

### SCENARIO: Batch sync — anniversary bonus (balance increase, no conflict)
POST http://localhost:3000/sync/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "workday",
  "timestamp": "2026-04-10T12:00:00Z",
  "balances": [
    { "employeeId": "emp-1", "locationId": "loc-nyc", "policyType": "VACATION", "available": 20, "used": 3 },
    { "employeeId": "emp-1", "locationId": "loc-nyc", "policyType": "SICK", "available": 12, "used": 1 }
  ]
}

### Verify — vacation bumped from 15 to 20 (anniversary bonus)
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-1/loc-nyc

###

### SCENARIO: Batch sync — seed new employees in bulk
POST http://localhost:3000/sync/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "workday",
  "timestamp": "2026-04-10T18:00:00Z",
  "balances": [
    { "employeeId": "emp-20", "locationId": "loc-sf", "policyType": "VACATION", "available": 18, "used": 0 },
    { "employeeId": "emp-20", "locationId": "loc-sf", "policyType": "SICK", "available": 8, "used": 0 },
    { "employeeId": "emp-21", "locationId": "loc-la", "policyType": "VACATION", "available": 15, "used": 2 }
  ]
}

### Verify new employees exist
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-20
